## Summary
The Supreme Court sided with the Trump administration in a legal dispute concerning mail-in voting. Justice Clarence Thomas made related comments during an appearance on Senator Ted Cruz's podcast.

## Key Points
- The Supreme Court ruled in favor of the Trump administration on a mail-in voting issue.
- Justice Clarence Thomas discussed this topic on Senator Ted Cruz's podcast.
- The decision may influence future election laws or legal precedents related to voting methods.


